      "title": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "Anil Seth argues that consciousness is unlikely to come along for the ride as AI gets smarter, because life and materiality matter — but our psychological biases and computational assumptions keep the mythology alive.",
      "sourceHeading": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI"
    },
