        "spya-nh8mt7",
        "spya-gxdsbh"
      ],
      "title": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "We are tempted to attribute consciousness to machines because we confuse intelligence, language and consciousness — a mistake driven by anthropocentrism, human exceptionalism, anthropomorphism and the lure of a techno-rapture.",
      "sourceHeading": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI"
    },
    "n0019": {
      "id": "n0019",
      "depth": 2,
      "parent": "n0018",
      "children": [
