        "n0026",
        "n0027"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-nh8mt7",
        "spya-xm96be"
      ],
      "title": "Intelligence is not consciousness",
      "gist": "Intelligence is about doing while consciousness is about being, so AI's capacity for intelligent behavior says nothing about whether there is anything it is like to be ChatGPT."
    },
