        "spya-d3g67c",
        "spya-cv97j7"
      ],
      "title": "Computational functionalism as assumption",
      "gist": "The very idea of conscious AI rests on the unexamined assumption that implementing the right computation is sufficient for consciousness, and four arguments challenge it."
    },
