        "n0135",
        "n0136"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-e7fdmb",
        "spya-vs0vpj"
      ],
      "title": "Don't create conscious machines",
      "gist": "Because no theory of consciousness is settled, deliberately creating conscious AI would be an ethical disaster, and emerging technologies like cerebral organoids may pose more immediate risk than LLMs."
    },
