        "spya-v98v5u",
        "spya-w8z40d"
      ],
      "title": "Soul Machine",
      "gist": "We can still choose which kinds of AI we want, and our true innermost essence lies not in immortal computation but in the feeling of being alive — more breath than thought and more meat than machine.",
      "sourceHeading": "Soul Machine"
    },
    "n0151": {
      "id": "n0151",
