      "range": [
        "spya-v98v5u",
        "spya-w4hwnc"
      ],
      "title": "Choosing AI's future",
      "gist": "There is no inevitability to AI's future direction, and mechanizing our view of mind does our brains and bodies a grave injustice unless we collectively decide otherwise."
    },
